{"parse":{"title":"个性/皎月","pageid":5271,"revid":12363,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E7%9A%8E%E6%9C%88&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E7%9A%8E%E6%9C%88&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E7%9A%8E%E6%9C%88&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>皎月</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.9A.8E.E6.9C.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"皎月\"><b>皎月</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 皎月.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8e/43ve0yj8v4s5t2g2u0gmp3rn5xdkv3b.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E7%9A%8E%E6%9C%88.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8e/43ve0yj8v4s5t2g2u0gmp3rn5xdkv3b.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E7%9A%8E%E6%9C%88.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8e/43ve0yj8v4s5t2g2u0gmp3rn5xdkv3b.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />皎月\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>造成的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"\">物理伤害</font></span></span>]视为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔法伤害</span>]。战斗开始时获得技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">皎月照拂</font></span>]。对<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内具有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"誓约\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">誓约</font></span></span>]的友军进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"援护防御\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">援护防御</font></span></span>]。自身行动结束或开始时,若自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内存在具有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"誓约\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">誓约</font></span></span>]的友军，则自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"值守\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">值守</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。<br />自身物防值加魔防值的<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>附加在物攻值上。行动结束时，若自身拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"值守\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">值守</font></span></span>]，则治疗自身和拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"誓约\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">誓约</font></span></span>]友军，治疗量为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">爱莎</span>]物攻值<font color=\"green\">40%</font>的生命值。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%8E\" title=\"角色图鉴库/爱莎\"><img alt=\"头像 爱莎.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4b/avapqa2vuo6ernxve07pidnrhletzcc.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">爱莎</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>造成的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"\">物理伤害</font></span></span>]视为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔法伤害</span>]。战斗开始时获得技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">皎月照拂</font></span>]。对<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内具有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"誓约\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">誓约</font></span></span>]的友军进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"援护防御\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">援护防御</font></span></span>]。自身行动结束或开始时,若自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内存在具有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"誓约\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">誓约</font></span></span>]的友军，则自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"值守\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">值守</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。<br />攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。自身物防值加魔防值的<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>附加在物攻值上。行动结束时，若自身拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"值守\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">值守</font></span></span>]，则治疗自身和拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"誓约\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">誓约</font></span></span>]友军，治疗量为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">爱莎</span>]物攻值<font color=\"green\">40%</font>的生命值。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8